@startuml ssd-probe-registration
' Reasoning: probe registration is a black-box platform interaction. The
' actor is the Probe Runtime; BEACON responds by registering or recognizing it.
title BEACON - SSD - Probe Registration

autonumber

actor "Probe Runtime" as probe
participant "BEACON Platform" as beacon

probe -> beacon : Send first heartbeat with probe identity and runtime details
beacon --> probe : Return registration result and runtime eligibility

@enduml
